  "description": "Recounts the Kishkindha, Sundara and Yuddha books of the Sanskrit Ramayana: Rama’s pact with Sugriva, Hanuman’s mission to Sita, the bridge to Lanka, war and the trial by fire. Examines Hanuman’s diplomacy, conflicting loyalties, Sita’s choices and the debated Uttara Kanda continuation, alongside the varied South and Southeast Asian traditions of retelling the epic.",
